<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hilton said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hilton said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney upgraded Hilton Hotels Corp to buy from outperform, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed at 28-1/8 Thursday.</p>
</text>
